Our business is subject to economic, political, regulatory and other risks associated with international operations.
Our business is subject to risks associated with conducting business internationally. We and a number of our suppliers and collaborative and clinical
study relationships are located outside the United States. Accordingly, our future results could be harmed by a variety of factors, including:
· economic weakness, including inflation, or political instability in particular non-U.S. economies and markets;
· differing regulatory requirements for drug approvals in non-U.S. countries;
