Any delays in completing our clinical studies will increase our costs, slow our product candidate development and approval process and jeopardize our
ability to commence product sales and generate sales revenues. Any of these occurrences may harm our business, financial condition and prospects
significantly. In addition, many of the factors that cause, or lead to, a delay in the commencement or completion of clinical studies may also ultimately lead
to the denial of regulatory approval of our product candidates.
Even if we obtain and maintain approval for our drug candidates from one jurisdiction, we may never obtain approval for our drug candidates in
other jurisdictions, which would limit our market opportunities and adversely affect our business.
